eOperationService;\n- MetadataService;\n- PreparationService;\n- AnalysisService;\n- SimilarityService;\n- MaintenanceService.\n\nServices coordinate domain and repositories. Long-running service calls are invoked as Jobs, not synchronously from UI handlers.\n\n### jobs\n\nOwns:\n- JobScheduler;\n- cancellation token;\n- bounded worker pools;","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":296,"fileSize":7784,"path":"/home/sean/Documents/experiments/csw-041026/koffer/docs/16-system-architecture.md","readRange":{"startLine":50,"endLine":149},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-f8c764bd-cff6-44b2-902b-44e3a310fdc4-25\nfc_p3vT8ib-3LYxF7-cbeff502-aws_ue1_1","startedAtMs":"1791146138040","completedAtMs":"1791146138395"},"model_call_id":"26bf19b6-86ee-4083-9345-1c9cee1a82d0-4-kmzu","session_id":"804b0afb-6b1f-43a7-a037-00f71d27cf01","timestamp_ms":1791146138354}
