{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-f8c764bd-cff6-44b2-902b-44e3a310fdc4-27\nfc_p3vT8ib-3LYxF7-cbeff502-aws_ue1_3","tool_call":{"readToolCall":{"args":{"path":"/home/sean/Documents/experiments/csw-041026/koffer/docs/19-audio-metadata-analysis-pipeline.md","limit":80},"result":{"success":{"content":"# 19. Audio, Metadata, and Analysis Pipeline\n\n## Supported file scope\n\nInitial required read/play/index support:\n- WAV;\n- AIFF/AIF;\n- FLAC;\n- MP3;\n- OGG/Vorbis;\n- M4A/AAC where the packaged FFmpeg/Qt backend supports it.\n\nUnsupported media is not indexed as a playable Sample.\n\n## Technical probing\n\nUse ffprobe through an argv-based subprocess wrapper, never shell string interpolation.\n\nRecord:\n- container;\n- codec;\n- duration;\n- sample rate;\n- channels/layout;\n- bitrate;\n- bit depth when reliably derivable.\n\nProbe failure is visible and does not crash Source scanning.\n\n## Playback\n\nPlaybackService wraps Qt Multimedia.\n\nRequired API concepts:\n- load(sample/path);\n- play;\n- pause;\n- stop/restart;\n- seek milliseconds;\n- loop region;\n- gain/volume;\n- state/position/error signals.\n\nThe UI never controls QMediaPlayer directly outside the adapter layer.\n\nIf a format probes successfully but cannot play through Qt Multimedia, Koffer reports playback unsupported/error while retaining the indexed Sample.\n\n## Waveform cache\n\nGenerate a compact min/max peak envelope from decoded PCM.\n\nRequirements:\n- cache key includes source fingerprint + waveform pipeline version;\n- lazy generation on demand plus optional background prebuild;\n- zoomed preparation view may request a higher-resolution envelope;\n- cache corruption causes rebuild, not data loss.\n\n## Preparation recipe\n\nCanonical JSON v1:\n\n~~~json\n{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"trim\": {\"start_ms\": 0, \"end_ms\": null},\n  \"fade_in_ms\": 0,\n  \"fade_out_ms\": 0,\n  \"gain_db\": 0.0,\n  \"normalize\": {\"enabled\": false, \"target_peak_dbfs\": -1.0},\n  \"transpose_semitones\": 0.0,\n  \"fine_cents\": 0,\n  \"time_stretch_ratio\": 1.0,\n  \"reverse\": false,\n  \"channels\": \"source\",\n  \"sample_rate_hz\": \"source\",\n  \"bit_depth\": \"source\",\n  \"output_format\": \"wav\"\n}\n~~~\n","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":271,"fileSize":7326,"path":"/home/sean/Documents/experiments/csw-041026/koffer/docs/19-audio-metadata-analysis-pipeline.md","readRange":{"startLine":1,"endLine":80},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-f8c764bd-cff6-44b2-902b-44e3a310fdc4-27\nfc_p3vT8ib-3LYxF7-cbeff502-aws_ue1_3","startedAtMs":"1791146138047","completedAtMs":"1791146138401"},"model_call_id":"26bf19b6-86ee-4083-9345-1c9cee1a82d0-4-kmzu","session_id":"804b0afb-6b1f-43a7-a037-00f71d27cf01","timestamp_ms":1791146138364}
