s: list[UUID]) -> None\nreorder(collection_id: UUID, ordered_sample_ids: list[UUID]) -> None\n~~~\n\nNo method mutates audio files.\n\n## SampleService\n\n~~~python\nget_detail(sample_id: UUID) -> SampleDetail\nset_favorite(sample_id: UUID, favorite: bool) -> None\nset_user_tags(sample_id: UUID, tags: list[str]) -> None\nset_classifications(sample_id: UUID, changes: ClassificationPatch) -> None\nreveal_path(sample_id: UUID) -> Path\n~~~\n\n## PlaybackService\n\nEvent-driven adapter:\n\n~~~python\nload(sample_id: UUID, path: Path) -> None\nplay() -> None\npause() -> None\nstop() -> None\nseek(position_ms: int) -> None\nset_loop(start_ms: int | None, end_ms: int | None) -> None\nset_gain_db(gain_db: float) -> None\n~~~\n\nSignals/events:\n- state_changed;\n- position_changed;","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":192,"fileSize":5594,"path":"/home/sean/Documents/experiments/csw-041026/.dreadnought/scratch/koffer/work/docs/27-service-interfaces.md","readRange":{"startLine":1,"endLine":80},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-ae9912df-5b70-41b9-8ca7-9c22dafaf276-22\nfc_p3vUCEs-6jKPYy-9640115a-aws_ue1_5","startedAtMs":"1791146344688","completedAtMs":"1791146344882"},"model_call_id":"45f02ac6-dd47-4d69-be46-6e4759d0020f-4-ijsr","session_id":"3787dc8c-fb4b-437d-a63e-5173987bf522","timestamp_ms":1791146344837}
